WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.616 --> 00:00:01.437
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

2
00:00:02.241 --> 00:00:07.417
<v><b>A:</b></v> Hi, Kim. Listen, do you want come to the theatre in London this Saturday?

3
00:00:07.596 --> 00:00:13.003
<v><b>B:</b></v> Saturday? I can’t – it’s my brother’s twenty-first birthday!

4
00:00:13.088 --> 00:00:15.962
We’re having a big party at my parents’ house.

5
00:00:16.031 --> 00:00:18.409
<v><b>A:</b></v> Oh, that sounds great!

6
00:00:18.546 --> 00:00:22.601
Have a wonderful time – and say ‘Happy Birthday’ from me!

7
00:00:24.089 --> 00:00:25.047
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

8
00:00:26.758 --> 00:00:29.119
<v><b>A:</b></v> Are you in the office next week?

9
00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:31.258
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, I’m on holiday.

10
00:00:31.377 --> 00:00:32.729
<v><b>A:</b></v> Where are you going?

11
00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:34.046
<v><b>B:</b></v> Australia!

12
00:00:34.714 --> 00:00:37.750
<v><b>A:</b></v> Lucky you! When do you get back?

13
00:00:37.862 --> 00:00:39.102
<v><b>B:</b></v> On the thirtieth.

14
00:00:39.333 --> 00:00:41.702
<v><b>A:</b></v> Wow! That’s a long holiday.

15
00:00:41.737 --> 00:00:44.833
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yeah, three weeks! I can’t wait.

16
00:00:47.639 --> 00:00:48.529
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

17
00:00:50.821 --> 00:00:53.088
<v><b>A:</b></v> You drink a lot of coffee!

18
00:00:53.371 --> 00:00:55.997
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, this is my fifth this morning.

19
00:00:56.031 --> 00:00:57.887
<v><b>A:</b></v> It’s not good for you, you know.

20
00:00:57.939 --> 00:01:00.616
<v><b>B:</b></v> I know, but I can’t wake up without it.

21
00:01:03.242 --> 00:01:04.029
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

22
00:01:06.176 --> 00:01:07.896
<v><b>A:</b></v> Where’s the restaurant?

23
00:01:08.007 --> 00:01:12.772
<v><b>B:</b></v> It’s not far. It’s on the corner of Park Avenue and fifty-third.

24
00:01:12.969 --> 00:01:16.117
<v><b>A:</b></v> Great. See you there at seven thirty.

25
00:01:19.128 --> 00:01:20.137
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

26
00:01:21.643 --> 00:01:25.013
<v><b>A:</b></v> Good morning. I’m here to see Lynn Mody.

27
00:01:25.218 --> 00:01:26.946
My name’s Graham Davies.

28
00:01:27.117 --> 00:01:29.855
<v><b>B:</b></v> Just a moment, sir, I’ll give her a ring

29
00:01:33.499 --> 00:01:42.019
…Is that Lynn? There’s a Mr Davies here to see you…That’s fine, sir.

30
00:01:42.053 --> 00:01:45.475
Could you sign in here? Great.

31
00:01:45.629 --> 00:01:49.667
You can go straight up. She’s on the sixth floor.

32
00:01:49.752 --> 00:01:51.455
The lifts are just over there.

33
00:01:51.694 --> 00:01:52.635
<v><b>A:</b></v> Many thanks.